PROGRAM loan request

GIVEN application is LoanApplication
  credit_score: 720
  annual_income: 96000
  monthly_debt: 2800
  home_price: 360000
  down_payment: 72000
  available_cash: 90000
  late_payments: [1]
  collections: []
  bankruptcies: 0
  employment_years: 4

GIVEN decision is LoanDecision
  principal: 0
  dti: 0
  ltv: 0
  reserve_months: 0
  risk_points: 0
  interest_rate: 0
  status: "new"
  reason: "new"

WHEN underwrite application into decision
